# No apple_id() here on purpose. Every lane authenticates with an App Store
# Connect API key (see docs/IOS-RELEASE.md) — that is a different credential
# from an Apple ID, needs no 2FA prompt in CI, and never expires. Wiring an
# apple_id in would invite fastlane to fall back to interactive Apple ID auth
# the moment the API key is missing, which fails confusingly on a headless
# runner instead of with the clear error the Fastfile gives.
